## 13. Risks and mitigations

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| Scope creep | Never ships | Phase gates; no work on Phase N+1 until N's acceptance passes |
| Supabase free pause / limits | Demo down | Keep-alive cron; export; upgrade trigger documented |
| Wasm build/CI friction | Slows Phase 1 | TS reference impl is the shipped default until Wasm passes the differential test |
| Proxy abuse (SSRF, open relay) | Account takeover of infra, legal | §6.2; ship last; rate limits; kill-switch env var |
| Secret scrubber false negatives | Users leak keys, trust lost | Best-effort wording, diff preview, public recall numbers, bug-bounty-style reports page |
| Passphrase loss on encrypted items | Permanent data loss | Warning plus confirm, export of ciphertext, no promise of recovery |
| HyperFrames license/runtime mismatch | Rework of Phase 3 | Verify before starting Phase 3 (1-hour spike) |
| Four themes x every component | QA multiplier | Semantic tokens, automated contrast + screenshot tests per theme |

